{"path":"string/basic_string_view/at","title":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::at","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>at","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/at","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a const reference to the character at specified location pos. Bounds checking is performed, exception of type std::out_of_range will be thrown on invalid access.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reference at<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a <code>const</code> reference to the character at specified location <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code>. Bounds checking is performed, exception of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> will be thrown on invalid access.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> position of the character to return\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code>Const</code> reference to the requested character.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdexcept&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> str_view<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"abcdef\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\": \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str_view.<span class=\"me1\">at</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\"><span class=\"kw772\">std::<span class=\"me2\">out_of_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Whooops. Index is out of range.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0: a\n1: b\n2: c\n3: d\n4: e\n5: f\n6: Whooops. Index is out of range.\nbasic_string_view::at: __pos (which is 6) &gt;= this-&gt;size() (which is 6)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/operator_at\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator[]</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the specified character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/at\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>at</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the specified character with bounds checking <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string_view","title":"std::basic_string_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::at","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Returns a const reference to the character at specified location pos."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pos"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Const reference to the requested character."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws std::out_of_range if pos >= size()."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator[]","note":"accesses the specified character"},{"label":"at","note":"accesses the specified character with bounds checking"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":166,"codeBlockCount":2}
